WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:40.000 --> 01:40.880
Is this true?

01:42.440 --> 01:44.240
My mother loved Sang Qi?

01:45.000 --> 01:46.720
She was forced to marry my father

01:46.800 --> 01:48.280
to nurture the Chaos Pearl?

01:52.000 --> 01:53.120
Qiumin.

02:09.880 --> 02:11.760
You've heard it all?

02:13.360 --> 02:15.120
Forget everything.

02:16.600 --> 02:17.960
Go back.

02:37.520 --> 02:40.000
They say a short separation
makes the reunion sweeter.

02:40.680 --> 02:42.720
Since you've set a barrier outside

02:44.120 --> 02:45.120
and no one else can come in anyway,

02:46.520 --> 02:47.360
so, why not…

02:56.280 --> 02:58.360
You've been away for too long.

02:58.960 --> 03:01.000
I couldn't wait for you,
so I thought I'd sleep first.

03:02.120 --> 03:03.400
Now that you're back,

03:03.480 --> 03:05.160
what do you say? Shall we continue?

03:05.760 --> 03:07.080
I still have many things to do.

03:07.640 --> 03:09.040
I can't always stay by your side.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.840
Let me take you back
to the Snow City first.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.280
The Snow City?

03:16.280 --> 03:17.120
What now?

03:17.200 --> 03:19.480
Are you going to lock
me back in the Ice Prison?

03:21.840 --> 03:22.680
No.

03:23.360 --> 03:25.120
No one can imprison you
in the Ice Prison again.

03:25.720 --> 03:26.960
No one.

03:31.200 --> 03:32.640
But Xie Xuechen,

03:33.480 --> 03:36.880
Sang Qi… he's forcing me
to help him find the Chaos Pearl.

03:38.720 --> 03:40.000
Come with me to the Snow City first.

03:40.840 --> 03:42.160
I'll figure out a way
to remove the Heartstring.

03:53.920 --> 03:57.080
Mr. Xie, you'd better not
force her to go to the Snow City.

03:57.920 --> 04:01.200
Otherwise, the Heartstring
left in her soul by His Grace

04:01.280 --> 04:03.160
will immediately take her life.

04:04.800 --> 04:06.320
You've even managed
to cultivate a projection?

04:08.120 --> 04:09.200
Did you really think

04:09.280 --> 04:12.000
the Illusion Elixir
could only be used once?

04:15.440 --> 04:16.519
Why is she here?

04:17.040 --> 04:18.640
Why did Master change the plan?

04:38.960 --> 04:40.560
Xie Xuechen's sword energy

04:41.160 --> 04:42.920
is truly powerful.

04:44.600 --> 04:47.040
The projection I carefully cultivated

04:47.120 --> 04:48.880
wasted after just one use.

04:48.960 --> 04:50.320
What a pity.

05:11.200 --> 05:12.280
Desire Demon, that fool…

05:12.360 --> 05:14.320
How could she lock me here?

05:17.360 --> 05:19.440
This is Xie Xuechen's Cage of Greed.

05:21.240 --> 05:23.320
Why would I end up in his Cage of Greed?

05:27.360 --> 05:29.240
He truly lives up
to the Lord of the Snow City.

05:29.960 --> 05:31.800
His thoughts
are always tied to this mountain.

05:34.680 --> 05:35.560
Fine,

05:36.160 --> 05:37.280
since I'm here,

05:37.360 --> 05:40.080
I might as well see what his greed
looks like now.

06:22.320 --> 06:23.280
Stop it!

06:38.320 --> 06:39.280
Father!

06:39.360 --> 06:41.520
I gave you Klicks

06:42.640 --> 06:45.960
so you could protect
the world with your sword.

06:46.840 --> 06:49.840
But you've disappointed me.

06:51.320 --> 06:53.760
I sent you to retreat at the Snow Cliff

06:53.840 --> 06:56.200
to purge your mind of distractions.

06:57.360 --> 06:59.680
You've disappointed me again.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.280
Do you still remember

07:03.800 --> 07:06.960
what you once promised me?

07:11.640 --> 07:13.000
"If I cannot strengthen my faith,

07:14.520 --> 07:15.480
I will never descend the mountain."

07:15.560 --> 07:18.560
Since you know your mistakes,
why not correct them?

07:24.840 --> 07:26.480
In the past,

07:27.000 --> 07:28.680
humans didn't have spiritual channels.

07:29.400 --> 07:31.360
We couldn't cultivate spiritual power.

07:31.880 --> 07:34.280
We could only look up to the Divine Clan

07:34.360 --> 07:36.320
and pray for their protection.

07:38.120 --> 07:40.800
Spiritual channels
are a gift from the Divine Clan.

07:41.480 --> 07:43.760
You were born with ten spiritual channels,

07:43.840 --> 07:45.840
favored by heaven and earth,

07:45.920 --> 07:47.840
yet you let personal feelings

07:47.920 --> 07:49.520
disrupt your sword's resolve

07:49.600 --> 07:50.760
and your faith!

07:55.880 --> 07:57.080
I don't understand.

08:00.280 --> 08:01.160
Father,

08:01.680 --> 08:02.880
I truly don't understand.

08:04.520 --> 08:06.600
I'm willing to die
for the people of the world.

08:07.480 --> 08:09.960
I can protect all the people
for a hundred years, a thousand years…

08:10.600 --> 08:12.520
Why can't I also love one person?

08:14.800 --> 08:16.640
Hopeless.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.960
She is your desire

08:30.680 --> 08:32.640
and also your inner demon.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.440
Kill her.

08:43.320 --> 08:45.560
It's just an illusion,

08:47.320 --> 08:49.000
yet you can't bring
yourself to destroy it?

08:51.800 --> 08:53.000
Or perhaps,

08:53.920 --> 08:56.760
you'd rather stay
trapped in this illusion?

08:58.960 --> 09:00.000
No.

09:01.120 --> 09:02.240
I won't kill her.

09:04.720 --> 09:05.560
If I can't let go,

09:06.520 --> 09:07.600
then I won't.

09:08.480 --> 09:10.080
She has never been my enemy,

09:11.040 --> 09:12.960
nor an obstacle
to the righteous path I seek.

09:32.240 --> 09:33.200
So,

09:34.000 --> 09:35.680
am I your inner demon?

09:58.640 --> 09:59.800
It's always been you.

10:02.520 --> 10:03.800
If you're here,

10:05.080 --> 10:06.360
does that mean

10:07.000 --> 10:08.920
this is your Cage of Greed as well?

10:10.320 --> 10:11.240
Then,

10:13.280 --> 10:14.760
am I also your inner demon?

10:17.840 --> 10:19.160
I remember now.

10:19.960 --> 10:21.840
Only two people
who are each other's desires

10:22.440 --> 10:24.760
can enter the same Cage of Greed.

10:26.080 --> 10:27.080
Is that true?

10:28.440 --> 10:29.640
Xie Xuechen

10:30.160 --> 10:31.080
is my inner demon too.

10:42.240 --> 10:43.520
Mu Xuanling…

10:49.560 --> 10:51.600
Fake. It's all fake!

11:00.200 --> 11:01.280
Mu Xuanling!

11:03.480 --> 11:04.360
Mu Xuanling!

11:06.400 --> 11:07.240
We're in the Two Realms Mountain.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.560
This place is fake.

11:09.640 --> 11:10.560
It's an illusion.

11:11.160 --> 11:12.320
I'll take you out.

11:13.520 --> 11:14.440
Break!

11:29.520 --> 11:31.280
I just sensed a surge of spiritual power.

11:31.920 --> 11:32.800
What happened?

11:32.880 --> 11:34.800
Moments ago,
Desire Demon's projection appeared.

11:35.480 --> 11:36.520
She mentioned

11:36.600 --> 11:38.800
Sang Qi had planted Heartstring
in Mu Xuanling's soul.

11:39.840 --> 11:41.440
After we broke free
from the Cage of Greed,

11:41.520 --> 11:42.800
this is how she ended up.

11:42.880 --> 11:44.520
I tried passing spiritual power,

11:44.600 --> 11:45.800
but it won't go in at all.

11:47.360 --> 11:48.880
In her soul?

11:51.720 --> 11:55.000
The Heartstring Sang Qi planted before

11:56.320 --> 11:58.160
was located in her heart vein.

11:58.240 --> 12:01.640
But now, it seems
the location has changed.

12:03.680 --> 12:05.200
You share the same
spiritual source with her.

12:05.280 --> 12:06.920
Try searching her spiritual platform

12:07.000 --> 12:08.400
for any problems.

12:33.880 --> 12:34.880
It's done.

12:38.040 --> 12:39.160
She doesn't have spiritual essence.

12:39.760 --> 12:41.800
Her spiritual platform
is too important for her.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.320
I didn't dare to forcibly erase it

12:44.400 --> 12:45.960
and could only temporarily seal it.

12:52.720 --> 12:54.760
If I hadn't allowed Sang Qi to take her,

12:56.920 --> 12:58.120
she wouldn't have suffered like this.

13:09.560 --> 13:10.720
Is that gray mole on her eyelid

13:10.800 --> 13:13.280
also a mark
of the Heartstring in her soul?

13:13.360 --> 13:15.120
Does she have anything else on her body?

13:21.880 --> 13:22.920
No, nothing else.

13:28.280 --> 13:34.160
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

13:34.240 --> 13:36.840
Your Grace, my projection is destroyed.

13:36.920 --> 13:38.040
But I don't understand.

13:38.120 --> 13:41.640
Why did you order me
to lock the Saintess in with him?

13:44.600 --> 13:45.960
Because

13:46.720 --> 13:48.520
they would share the same cage.

13:51.480 --> 13:52.560
I

13:53.080 --> 13:54.800
want Xie Xuechen

13:54.880 --> 13:56.280
to know this.

13:58.720 --> 13:59.800
So,

14:00.320 --> 14:02.760
the Saintess also loves Xie Xuechen?

14:02.840 --> 14:04.240
But why would she…

14:12.400 --> 14:14.400
Even if you recall something,

14:14.480 --> 14:16.160
as long as the Disillusion Water
remains in your body,

14:16.680 --> 14:18.920
you'll feel that piercing pain again

14:19.000 --> 14:21.160
and once more forget all your emotions.

14:22.320 --> 14:25.160
Xie Xuechen,
who believes Mu Xuanling loves him,

14:25.240 --> 14:27.480
and Mu Xuanling, who
no longer loves Xie Xuechen…

14:28.640 --> 14:29.840
Good disciple,

14:30.480 --> 14:34.480
isn't this plan
far more brilliant than yours?

14:42.080 --> 14:43.640
-Xie Xuechen…
-Miss Mu.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.240
Mu Xuanling.

14:51.840 --> 14:52.920
Xie Xuechen.

14:56.160 --> 14:57.320
Xie Xuechen.

14:59.960 --> 15:01.000
Xie Xuechen!

15:04.240 --> 15:05.400
It's fine now.

15:06.280 --> 15:07.800
Without breaking the Disillusion Water,

15:07.880 --> 15:09.320
how can she possibly feel love?

15:11.320 --> 15:12.960
The Heartstring has been sealed.

15:13.680 --> 15:14.640
It's fine now.

15:39.480 --> 15:42.240
Now Xie Xuechen and I
are in love with each other.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.320
You enter my tent alone

15:44.920 --> 15:47.200
while he's away. Is that proper?

15:48.720 --> 15:50.080
Or perhaps

15:50.600 --> 15:52.160
our Mr. Nan prefers it this way?

15:54.040 --> 15:55.360
Last night,

15:55.440 --> 15:57.680
you deliberately led us
to discover the Heartstring,

15:58.440 --> 15:59.480
didn't you?

16:01.560 --> 16:02.640
How strange.

16:03.920 --> 16:05.800
It always seems that deceiving you

16:06.400 --> 16:08.240
is harder than deceiving Xie Xuechen.

16:08.320 --> 16:10.000
You're even willing

16:11.000 --> 16:13.040
to endure piercing pain
just to deceive him.

16:15.160 --> 16:16.680
If I can fool Xie Xuechen,

16:17.400 --> 16:19.600
what does a little pain matter?

16:20.480 --> 16:22.600
But I didn't expect
Desire Demon to show up.

16:22.680 --> 16:24.920
Perhaps Master thought
the act wasn't convincing enough.

16:33.600 --> 16:35.240
After such suffering,

16:35.960 --> 16:38.320
Xie Xuechen will certainly
never leave me alone again.

16:38.400 --> 16:39.440
Otherwise,

16:40.040 --> 16:41.960
he'd surely send me back to the Snow City.

16:42.560 --> 16:44.160
And that's not part of my plan.

16:48.280 --> 16:50.120
Looking at you now,

16:51.320 --> 16:52.840
you seem quite unfamiliar.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.800
This is the real me.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.440
The one before was just a disguise.

17:09.680 --> 17:11.079
You've kept it a secret for me,

17:11.599 --> 17:13.200
not telling Xie Xuechen.

17:13.839 --> 17:15.119
I'm touched.

17:16.200 --> 17:17.160
To me,

17:17.760 --> 17:20.359
Xie Xuechen is nothing more
than a key to finding the Chaos Pearl.

17:22.839 --> 17:24.720
But you're different from others.

17:27.400 --> 17:28.520
You're clever.

17:29.920 --> 17:31.600
You saw through me at first glance.

17:33.600 --> 17:34.720
When we first met,

17:35.320 --> 17:37.440
I thought you were a threat.

17:37.520 --> 17:38.680
But now,

17:38.760 --> 17:40.400
I've changed my mind.

17:41.520 --> 17:43.240
Perhaps

17:43.320 --> 17:46.000
we can become closer friends.

17:48.560 --> 17:49.640
Right?

17:57.840 --> 17:59.200
You removed the barrier.

18:00.080 --> 18:01.480
Does that mean
you trust her completely now?

18:02.960 --> 18:04.640
She's indeed different from before

18:05.320 --> 18:06.840
and still has some suspicious aspects.

18:07.760 --> 18:09.160
But I want to trust her.

18:11.560 --> 18:13.160
What if she causes trouble again?

18:13.240 --> 18:15.080
If she causes trouble
right in front of me,

18:15.160 --> 18:16.720
then it would be my failure.

18:20.440 --> 18:22.280
You're just like your sword,

18:22.360 --> 18:23.480
always charging forward.

18:24.240 --> 18:26.320
It seems there's no outcome
that's unbearable.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.320
I should leave now.

18:31.560 --> 18:33.680
-But as for Mu Xuanling…
-You don't need to worry about her.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.520
I'll take good care of her.

18:42.360 --> 18:43.200
Got it.

18:43.280 --> 18:44.520
I'm leaving.

19:00.520 --> 19:04.320
REJUVENATION PAVILION

19:13.680 --> 19:15.240
Master is so peculiar.

19:15.320 --> 19:16.800
There must be more secrets hidden.

19:17.320 --> 19:18.920
It's probably related to the Chaos Pearl.

19:19.520 --> 19:21.240
I need to inform Xie Xuechen soon.

19:55.280 --> 19:56.360
-Sir.
-Sir.

19:57.280 --> 19:59.160
No, I can't go directly.

19:59.240 --> 20:01.200
If the Mirage Palace's disciples see me,

20:01.280 --> 20:02.760
they'll surely report it to Master.

20:05.760 --> 20:07.320
What's so fascinating to peek at?

20:14.760 --> 20:16.280
Haven't you gone back
to the Dark Abyss with Sang Qi?

20:16.880 --> 20:19.280
My friends and loved one
are all in the human realm.

20:19.360 --> 20:20.560
Of course, I came back.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.000
There's no way Sang Qi
would let you return so easily.

20:25.080 --> 20:26.200
I don't believe it.

20:26.280 --> 20:28.280
Naturally, my heart was with Xie Xuechen,

20:28.360 --> 20:29.360
so I risked my life to come back.

20:32.400 --> 20:34.240
I considered you a friend,

20:34.320 --> 20:36.280
but you can't even trust me a little.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.280
Friend?

20:44.120 --> 20:46.400
At most, we're just on greeting terms.

20:46.480 --> 20:47.640
I showed you a bit of respect,

20:47.720 --> 20:48.920
and you got all proud.

20:50.360 --> 20:52.280
I must've been overthinking it.

20:54.760 --> 20:57.280
If you want to be friends with me,
I won't stop you.

20:57.360 --> 20:58.760
But I'll tell you this.

20:58.840 --> 20:59.880
Don't try anything tricky.

20:59.960 --> 21:02.080
Otherwise,
I'll pound you like this, punch by punch,

21:02.160 --> 21:03.680
-until you're a pig head!
-Xie Xuechen will leave. Hurry up!

21:04.320 --> 21:05.640
No… Wait a moment!

21:05.720 --> 21:07.720
Wait a moment! Wait!
I can't go over there.

21:07.800 --> 21:09.000
If I go over and the Mirage Palace's
people discover me,

21:09.080 --> 21:10.800
Master won't spare me. I'm begging you…

21:10.880 --> 21:13.520
The Mirage Palace's disciples
are all patrolling the outer circle.

21:13.600 --> 21:14.720
Otherwise, how would I show up here?

21:15.600 --> 21:17.400
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

21:20.000 --> 21:21.120
Xie Xuechen!

21:27.040 --> 21:28.320
Miss Gao, you sneaked here.

21:28.840 --> 21:30.200
You must've found something.

21:31.560 --> 21:32.760
Follow me.

21:32.840 --> 21:35.280
This matter
must be related to Saint Miaohua.

21:37.360 --> 21:38.680
In other words,

21:38.760 --> 21:40.800
the former master of the Mirage Palace,
Saint Miaohua,

21:40.880 --> 21:41.960
made an agreement with Mr. Gao.

21:42.040 --> 21:44.680
Saint Miaohua
forced your mother to marry Mr. Gao,

21:44.760 --> 21:47.080
using her Primal Celestial Maiden physique
to nurture the Chaos Pearl.

21:49.440 --> 21:51.280
But they didn't say

21:51.360 --> 21:53.280
that Saint Miaohua
replaced the real Chaos Pearl.

21:55.520 --> 21:57.640
If the Chaos Pearl
is not in the Mirage Palace,

21:58.240 --> 21:59.440
then why would
Su Ningzhen be so frightened

21:59.520 --> 22:00.520
that she passed her power to Miss Gao?

22:01.320 --> 22:04.000
Unless she was frightened by our Mr. Xie.

22:07.320 --> 22:10.160
But they did mention the real Chaos Pearl.

22:10.240 --> 22:12.400
It's just that
they didn't say where it is.

22:12.480 --> 22:14.840
When I left the palace, I went straight
to find Saint Miaohua overnight.

22:16.360 --> 22:17.920
I heard that after Saint Miaohua

22:18.000 --> 22:20.120
stepped down as Master,
she wandered the world

22:20.200 --> 22:22.000
and was never seen again.

22:22.080 --> 22:23.360
It turns out, she's still
near the Mirage Palace.

22:25.880 --> 22:27.000
When I was young,

22:27.080 --> 22:30.320
I secretly followed Master
to the woods near the Mirage Palace.

22:30.400 --> 22:31.680
There was a cave there.

22:32.280 --> 22:34.680
When Master discovered me, she was mad

22:35.280 --> 22:36.320
and immediately took me away.

22:37.160 --> 22:40.040
Later, Master told me
that Saint Miaohua lived there.

22:41.520 --> 22:43.560
Back then, she had fallen gravely ill.

22:43.640 --> 22:45.680
After passing the position to my master,

22:45.760 --> 22:47.000
she hid herself away there.

22:47.640 --> 22:50.720
Master kept this a secret
to prevent anyone from disturbing her.

22:51.360 --> 22:52.760
However,

22:52.840 --> 22:54.600
when I went to the cave this time,

22:55.200 --> 22:57.680
I discovered that Master had lied to me.

23:44.320 --> 23:47.240
SAINT MIAOHUA

23:51.800 --> 23:53.120
Who are you?

23:56.080 --> 23:57.320
Madam,

23:58.640 --> 23:59.800
it's me, Qiumin!

24:01.680 --> 24:02.960
Gao Qiumin.

24:03.560 --> 24:05.400
Back then, you and Master

24:05.480 --> 24:07.120
brought me from Moonlight Heights.

24:12.840 --> 24:14.720
You are that child…

24:16.040 --> 24:18.360
What… What is going on here?

24:23.680 --> 24:26.440
Naturally, it's the work
of my dear disciple.

24:27.680 --> 24:29.320
Her sister died.

24:30.840 --> 24:33.520
She was disturbed by endless nightmares

24:33.600 --> 24:35.520
and unable to sleep.

24:37.280 --> 24:40.640
Only by occasionally
coming to see me like this

24:41.600 --> 24:43.360
can she find peace of mind.

24:51.360 --> 24:52.560
What do you know,

24:53.400 --> 24:55.080
and why have you come?

24:56.160 --> 24:58.200
I want to ask you
where the Chaos Pearl is.

25:01.960 --> 25:03.960
The one in the Snow City

25:04.640 --> 25:06.480
was found to be a fake?

25:12.280 --> 25:15.640
No wonder she passed her power to you.

25:22.400 --> 25:24.520
Did you hide the Chaos Pearl?

25:25.480 --> 25:27.200
Then, where is it now?

25:35.720 --> 25:39.080
No one hid the Chaos Pearl.

25:41.600 --> 25:44.720
It's just that no one can find it.

25:47.440 --> 25:49.680
"No one hid the Chaos Pearl.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.480
It's just that no one can find it."

25:54.280 --> 25:55.600
What did she mean by that?

25:56.960 --> 25:58.160
I don't know either.

25:58.240 --> 26:01.920
And I've never seen Master hide anything.

26:03.160 --> 26:04.160
Perhaps

26:04.240 --> 26:06.080
the Chaos Pearl
truly isn't within the Mirage Palace.

26:07.520 --> 26:09.880
During the conversation
between Madam Su and the Elder,

26:09.960 --> 26:12.200
they mentioned there are clues
from back then in Moonlight Heights.

26:12.280 --> 26:14.520
If they don't want others
to know the truth,

26:14.600 --> 26:15.840
then something from the past

26:16.360 --> 26:18.800
might hold the key
to finding the Chaos Pearl.

26:20.400 --> 26:22.280
At the time, I was very young,

26:22.360 --> 26:24.120
so I don't remember much.

26:25.440 --> 26:27.880
And my father never allowed me
into my mother's room.

26:29.840 --> 26:31.680
We have to investigate Moonlight Heights.

26:31.760 --> 26:32.600
We must hurry.

26:32.680 --> 26:34.520
I snuck out of the Mirage Palace.

26:34.600 --> 26:37.000
If Master finds out,
she'll surely send people after me.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.840
-You don't need to--
-Of course, I'll go with you

26:41.920 --> 26:43.480
to Moonlight Heights.

26:43.560 --> 26:44.840
There might be danger.

26:45.720 --> 26:48.040
And the Heartstring within you
might cause changes.

26:48.120 --> 26:50.840
Hasn't the Heartstring
already been sealed?

26:50.920 --> 26:53.080
Besides, I've mastered
the Jade Vault Technique.

26:53.680 --> 26:54.600
If there's any danger,

26:54.680 --> 26:57.040
all the more reason for me
to fight alongside you!

26:57.120 --> 26:59.440
Moreover, with Nan Xuyue absent,

26:59.520 --> 27:01.000
if the Heartstring causes trouble,

27:01.080 --> 27:02.280
who but you can keep me in check?

27:05.200 --> 27:08.040
You wouldn't want me
to stir up trouble again, would you?

27:12.560 --> 27:13.600
Let's go.

27:19.200 --> 27:20.200
Wait.

27:20.280 --> 27:22.200
When did Mu Xuanling
start practicing the Jade Vault Technique?

27:22.280 --> 27:25.120
Isn't that Xie Xuechen's technique?

27:25.200 --> 27:26.800
And what is Heartstring?
What's the danger?

27:26.880 --> 27:28.400
Wait, you two! Hold on for me!

27:28.480 --> 27:30.080
Can't anyone explain this to me?

27:30.160 --> 27:32.280
Mister, turn the pages faster!

27:32.360 --> 27:34.800
Faster!

27:34.880 --> 27:36.760
Bao, I've been flipping
through these for days.

27:37.360 --> 27:38.200
Can I take a break?

27:40.480 --> 27:43.240
But I haven't seen my father in so long.

27:43.320 --> 27:46.560
I'm really scared
that I'll forget what he looks like.

27:49.960 --> 27:52.160
Didn't you say
you've never seen your father before?

27:53.920 --> 27:56.280
I'm scared my mother

27:56.360 --> 27:58.440
will forget what he looks like.

27:58.520 --> 27:59.440
Alright!

28:00.160 --> 28:01.120
Bao, don't cry.

28:01.920 --> 28:03.280
I will definitely help you find him, okay?

28:05.800 --> 28:06.960
Next volume.

28:31.240 --> 28:32.200
PEDIGREES

28:39.760 --> 28:40.840
Time to eat?

28:40.920 --> 28:43.480
Mister, can you help me search
for my father a little longer, please?

28:44.080 --> 28:45.000
Bao,

28:45.520 --> 28:46.480
look…

28:47.120 --> 28:49.040
I have really flipped
through every single page.

28:50.120 --> 28:51.280
There's no Fu Cangli

28:52.120 --> 28:53.160
in the Jade Sky Palace.

28:54.240 --> 28:56.840
Then, where's my father?

28:58.200 --> 29:01.040
I miss my father.

29:01.120 --> 29:03.040
-I want to find my father!
-Bao…

29:03.120 --> 29:05.800
-Bao, listen to me. Okay?
-Please keep looking.

29:05.880 --> 29:07.320
-Bao…
-I want to find my father!

29:07.400 --> 29:08.440
Maybe there's another way.

29:23.240 --> 29:25.200
Father, I'm begging you!

29:25.280 --> 29:26.400
Just let me use the Blood Mirror.

29:27.000 --> 29:29.520
Once I help Bao find her father,
I'll return it to you immediately.

29:30.480 --> 29:31.920
You don't care

29:32.000 --> 29:33.440
about the family business,

29:33.520 --> 29:34.640
nor do you focus on your cultivation.

29:35.240 --> 29:37.000
As the Young Lord,

29:37.080 --> 29:39.080
you spend all your time
hanging around a little Spirit Clan girl.

29:39.800 --> 29:40.960
How disgraceful!

29:42.240 --> 29:43.640
Bao is just a little girl

29:43.720 --> 29:44.840
who traveled all this way
to find her father.

29:45.720 --> 29:47.960
Since I promised to help her,
I must keep my word.

29:48.760 --> 29:49.800
So what?

29:49.880 --> 29:51.600
Why did she end up here?

29:51.680 --> 29:52.800
Honestly!

29:54.240 --> 29:56.360
Her father is called Fu Cangli,

29:57.240 --> 29:59.840
said to be the richest
human cultivator alive.

30:00.600 --> 30:02.600
I think he might be connected
to our Jade Sky Palace.

30:03.240 --> 30:05.080
-What's her father's name again?
-Fu Cangli.

30:11.400 --> 30:13.200
Father, do you know him?

30:16.760 --> 30:18.440
No. I've never heard of him.

30:22.600 --> 30:24.880
You've been flipping
through family records

30:24.960 --> 30:25.800
and name registries recently.

30:26.800 --> 30:28.360
Was it to look for her father?

30:30.560 --> 30:31.760
That little girl

30:32.520 --> 30:34.000
is from the Spirit Clan.

30:34.080 --> 30:36.000
Her father's a human cultivator.

30:37.200 --> 30:41.080
Obviously, he married a Spirit Clan wife.

30:42.320 --> 30:44.360
Do you know
where their family usually lived?

30:44.440 --> 30:46.280
How would I know?

30:46.360 --> 30:47.600
I didn't ask that much.

30:47.680 --> 30:49.520
Bao just said her father left years ago

30:49.600 --> 30:50.840
and never came back home.

30:50.920 --> 30:53.120
So, Father, we really need to help her.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.360
If we can't find him here,

30:54.440 --> 30:55.880
then give me
the Blood Mirror and I'll look outside.

30:55.960 --> 30:56.800
No way!

30:57.840 --> 30:59.160
Why not?

31:00.280 --> 31:02.120
It's just a Blood Mirror.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.600
Let me borrow it, right?

31:03.680 --> 31:04.840
-Right.
-Dear, you…

31:04.920 --> 31:06.560
Bring it out.

31:07.400 --> 31:08.560
Bring it out!

31:08.640 --> 31:09.720
The Blood Mirror.

31:15.080 --> 31:16.000
Thank you, Mother!

31:19.120 --> 31:20.600
You always know how to care for people.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.160
Here…

31:26.320 --> 31:27.360
How does that feel?

31:27.440 --> 31:28.680
Comfortable?

31:28.760 --> 31:29.680
Let me massage you a bit more.

31:35.040 --> 31:36.000
The Blood Mirror…

31:44.720 --> 31:45.640
Thank you, Mother.

31:48.480 --> 31:49.520
Bao!

31:50.720 --> 31:51.680
Dear,

31:51.760 --> 31:53.720
why did you have to lend it to him?

31:54.560 --> 31:56.160
You've used the Blood Mirror before.

31:56.240 --> 31:58.880
Aside from what Lansheng saw,
you couldn't see anything else.

31:59.840 --> 32:00.800
The Blood Mirror

32:01.320 --> 32:03.440
requires blood
from a close relative to work.

32:04.320 --> 32:06.040
That's why fate is like this.

32:06.680 --> 32:08.880
If someone can't be found,
they simply can't be found.

32:10.320 --> 32:11.160
And those meant to return

32:11.880 --> 32:13.520
can't be stopped.

32:14.320 --> 32:15.480
Let them go.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.200
Maybe

32:17.840 --> 32:19.080
they'll get some results.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.400
Will this treasure

32:29.160 --> 32:30.520
really help me find my father?

32:31.760 --> 32:34.200
This mirror is called the Blood Mirror.

32:34.280 --> 32:36.400
My father obtained it
from an evil cultivator.

32:37.000 --> 32:39.400
This evil cultivator practiced
blood sacrifice techniques.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.960
He used his own blood as a medium,

32:41.040 --> 32:43.000
making others drink it.

32:43.080 --> 32:44.160
Then, with this Blood Mirror,

32:44.240 --> 32:46.840
he could gain the vision
of those connected to his bloodline.

32:47.520 --> 32:49.240
He could see what they saw.

32:50.640 --> 32:53.280
I was curious once.
I dripped my own blood on it,

32:53.360 --> 32:55.200
and ended up seeing
what my mother was seeing.

32:56.160 --> 32:59.640
Then, if I drip my own blood on it,

33:00.400 --> 33:01.960
can I see my father then?

33:03.880 --> 33:04.960
No.

33:05.040 --> 33:07.160
You'd only see what he's currently seeing.

33:29.040 --> 33:30.760
Who are these three people?

33:31.640 --> 33:32.720
I can't see clearly.

33:58.280 --> 33:59.920
Why does it feel like I'm being watched?

34:00.760 --> 34:01.720
It must be an illusion.

34:05.520 --> 34:07.520
Could your father
be trying to follow them?

34:08.120 --> 34:10.199
Is it possible he plans to rob them?

34:10.280 --> 34:13.960
My father has tons of treasures.
Why would he rob anyone?

34:17.920 --> 34:19.560
The spiritual herbs
around them are quite rare.

34:20.159 --> 34:22.000
I've heard they only grow
near Moonlight Heights.

34:22.719 --> 34:23.560
Moonlight Heights?

34:25.000 --> 34:26.040
Take the Blood Mirror.

34:26.120 --> 34:27.199
Let's go. Let's meet your father.

34:27.280 --> 34:28.360
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS TOWN

34:28.440 --> 34:30.120
Fresh vegetables!

34:30.920 --> 34:33.040
Homegrown vegetables!

34:33.120 --> 34:34.000
CLOTHING SHOP

34:34.080 --> 34:35.320
-Here you go!
-Sir,

34:35.400 --> 34:37.000
-want some vegetables?
-No, thanks.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.040
Buns!

34:39.639 --> 34:40.760
Buns!

34:41.800 --> 34:43.239
This place

34:43.320 --> 34:45.040
-didn't use to be this desolate.
-Buns!

34:45.120 --> 34:46.960
Hot buns!

34:50.199 --> 34:51.199
Excuse me, sir.

34:52.280 --> 34:53.120
May I ask

34:53.760 --> 34:55.159
why this town is so deserted?

34:56.760 --> 34:59.800
Do you know there used to be a manor
called Moonlight Heights here?

35:03.480 --> 35:04.880
It's said that years ago,

35:04.960 --> 35:06.800
a group of demons came here

35:06.880 --> 35:09.720
and slaughtered everyone in that manor.

35:09.800 --> 35:13.000
Even the cultivators there
were all wiped out.

35:13.080 --> 35:14.800
The town was affected too.

35:15.400 --> 35:17.680
Everyone said this place was cursed,

35:17.760 --> 35:19.840
so too many people died here.

35:19.920 --> 35:23.000
And since then, no one
would come to protect us anymore.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.880
So, those who could leave, left.

35:27.320 --> 35:28.360
Sir,

35:28.440 --> 35:30.520
then why do you still stay here?

35:31.520 --> 35:34.080
Me? I was born here.

35:34.160 --> 35:36.720
If I leave, where would I even go?

35:38.040 --> 35:39.920
-Want some?
-No, thank you.

35:40.600 --> 35:41.920
Alright. Take care.

35:43.000 --> 35:45.280
After my master was taken away,

35:45.360 --> 35:47.320
she never returned to this place.

35:47.400 --> 35:49.320
-I didn't expect…
-You didn't kill those people.

35:50.120 --> 35:51.360
What you should do is avenge them,

35:51.440 --> 35:52.600
not to feel sad.

35:53.640 --> 35:56.000
Is she… comforting me?

35:57.480 --> 35:59.200
Stop wasting time

35:59.280 --> 36:00.200
on pointless sorrow.

36:04.160 --> 36:05.320
Let's go.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.880
Let's head to Moonlight Heights first.

36:06.960 --> 36:08.000
Hi, there!

36:09.120 --> 36:10.720
-Xuanling!
-It's been a while!

36:12.120 --> 36:13.320
-Mr. Fu!
-Fu Lansheng!

36:13.400 --> 36:17.880
Xuanling, I've missed you so much!
You've finally come back,

36:17.960 --> 36:18.880
Xuanling…

36:18.960 --> 36:20.520
I missed you too.

36:20.600 --> 36:22.480
If only you could sniff out
where the Chaos Pearl is,

36:22.560 --> 36:23.440
that would be even better.

36:23.520 --> 36:25.440
How did you know we were here?

36:26.040 --> 36:27.480
Funny enough, it's a short story.

36:28.240 --> 36:30.160
Mister, I've made a new discovery. Look!

36:33.240 --> 36:34.120
We used the Blood Mirror

36:34.200 --> 36:36.320
and found out
that Bao's father was following you.

36:36.400 --> 36:37.400
So, we came along.

36:38.240 --> 36:40.320
Why would Bao's father follow us?

36:41.280 --> 36:42.360
No idea.

36:42.960 --> 36:43.960
Later, when we used
the Blood Mirror again,

36:44.040 --> 36:44.880
we couldn't see anything.

36:45.920 --> 36:48.440
I suspect he used some method
to block the artifact's detection.

36:49.120 --> 36:51.600
Your father sure is mysterious.

36:55.080 --> 36:56.600
So, what are your plans now?

36:57.720 --> 36:59.280
The Blood Mirror doesn't work anymore,

36:59.960 --> 37:01.200
but following you

37:01.280 --> 37:02.680
might help us find Bao's father.

37:08.720 --> 37:09.880
You still haven't found her?

37:10.480 --> 37:11.320
No.

37:11.840 --> 37:13.520
I've already sent more people

37:13.600 --> 37:14.600
to search the roads

37:14.680 --> 37:16.440
from Mirage Palace to Moonlight Heights.

37:18.040 --> 37:19.600
Had I known this would happen,

37:19.680 --> 37:21.280
I should've locked her up in this room!

37:21.360 --> 37:23.880
But can you lock her up forever?

37:24.920 --> 37:25.840
Once suspicion takes root,

37:26.440 --> 37:27.480
there will be no peace.

37:28.440 --> 37:30.440
I just visited the back mountain.

37:30.520 --> 37:32.440
Qiumin has met with Saint Miaohua.

37:36.520 --> 37:39.000
She's becoming
more and more disobedient lately.

37:40.040 --> 37:41.640
Let her meet, then.

37:41.720 --> 37:44.960
For that woman,
the most important thing is Mirage Palace.

37:46.520 --> 37:48.320
She won't reveal anything to her.

37:48.400 --> 37:50.280
Right now, the most important thing

37:50.360 --> 37:51.680
isn't finding Qiumin.

38:03.040 --> 38:04.080
Forget it.

38:04.720 --> 38:06.200
That place can't be left as it is.

38:07.880 --> 38:10.680
Send people with celestial artifacts
to Moonlight Heights

38:10.760 --> 38:13.160
and destroy the entire house
where my sister lived.

38:15.800 --> 38:16.840
Understood.

38:31.800 --> 38:34.960
Why are you so curious about the past?

38:37.200 --> 38:38.600
Some things

38:39.640 --> 38:42.040
are better left buried.

38:51.600 --> 38:56.160
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

39:15.120 --> 39:16.120
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

39:24.720 --> 39:25.760
Miss Gao.

39:25.840 --> 39:27.880
Miss Gao. What's wrong?

39:29.160 --> 39:30.040
It's nothing.

39:30.560 --> 39:33.200
I just recalled some things from the past.

39:34.720 --> 39:36.920
Let's search my mother's room first.
There might be clues there.

39:41.680 --> 39:44.440
I never imagined
this place would end up like this.

39:44.520 --> 39:46.240
You also experienced
what happened back then.

39:46.320 --> 39:48.160
Seeing all this, doesn't it scare you?

39:48.960 --> 39:50.320
I barely remember

39:51.040 --> 39:51.960
what happened back then.

39:52.960 --> 39:54.080
Barely remember?

39:55.160 --> 39:56.400
You used to hold hatred pretty well.

39:58.880 --> 40:01.400
Now, I can barely remember.
Isn't that a good thing?

40:24.800 --> 40:25.800
This is my mother's room.

40:37.120 --> 40:39.200
This is actually the first time
I've been inside her room.

40:43.240 --> 40:44.600
Bao, it's dusty here.

40:44.680 --> 40:46.400
-Wait outside for us.
-Alright.

40:51.000 --> 40:52.280
Let's split up and search.

41:03.600 --> 41:04.600
Strange.

41:05.200 --> 41:07.240
It doesn't look like anyone lived here.

41:08.680 --> 41:10.400
Could someone have packed up
your mother's belongings?

41:11.480 --> 41:12.600
Impossible.

41:12.680 --> 41:15.120
When I was little, my father would
stay here all afternoon whenever came.

41:15.200 --> 41:17.160
He never let anyone
come near my mother's room.

41:33.680 --> 41:34.840
This array was set up by some master.

41:35.600 --> 41:37.600
We have similar locking arrays
in the Jade Sky Palace.

41:37.680 --> 41:40.000
They're used to protect precious artifacts
and spiritual herbs.

41:40.080 --> 41:42.560
Unless you know
how to break the locking array,

41:42.640 --> 41:43.520
there's

41:43.600 --> 41:45.640
absolutely no way to open this door.

41:52.600 --> 41:54.720
I… I don't know how to break it.

42:06.920 --> 42:07.960
Step aside.

42:20.200 --> 42:23.080
The secret is right in front of us.
Let's see.

42:28.280 --> 42:31.440
There's such a deep secret passage
hidden beneath my mother's room!

42:32.120 --> 42:33.800
My father never told me about this.

42:34.320 --> 42:37.040
It seems that Gao Fengxu
kept quite a few secrets,

42:37.120 --> 42:38.600
even from his own daughter.
